<div class="wrap page-head">
  <p class="eyebrow">Secondary · 11 to 14 years</p>
  <h1>More independence, bigger projects</h1>
  <p class="lede">Secondary follows Cambridge Lower Secondary in English, Maths, and Science, taught by subject specialists on our Secondary Campus. Classes stay at {{ site.classCap }} or fewer. The day still includes PE and a vocational class, but students carry more of the planning themselves.</p>
</div>

