      <h2>The academic core</h2>
      <p>Each core subject has its own teacher with a degree in the field. <strong>English</strong> moves into literature, argument, and writing for an audience. <strong>Maths</strong> builds toward the reasoning needed for IGCSE-level work. <strong>Science</strong> covers biology, chemistry, and physics with practical work every week.</p>
